{"docKey":"0416_partition_equal_subset_sum","code":"from typing import List\nfrom functools import cache\n\nclass Solution:\n    \"\"\"\n    分割等和子集 - 记忆化搜索解法\n\n    核心思路：\n    1. 计算数组总和，如果是奇数直接返回 False\n    2. 问题转化为：能否凑出和为总和一半的子集\n    3. 使用记忆化搜索，dfs(i, remain) 表示从第 i 个数开始能否凑出 remain\n\n    时间复杂度: O(n * target)\n    空间复杂度: O(n * target)\n    \"\"\"\n    def canPartition(self, nums: List[int]) -> bool:\n        total = sum(nums)\n        if total % 2 != 0:\n            return False\n\n        target = total // 2\n        n = len(nums)\n\n        @cache\n        def dfs(start: int, remain: int) -> bool:\n            if remain == 0:\n                return True\n            if remain < 0 or start >= n:\n                return False\n            return dfs(start + 1, remain - nums[start]) or \\\n                   dfs(start + 1, remain)\n\n        return dfs(0, target)","method":"canPartition","paramNames":["nums"],"args":["[1,5,11,5]"],"expected":"true","result":true,"events":[{"line":17,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5]},"depth":1},{"line":18,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5],"total":22},"depth":1},{"line":21,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5],"total":22},"depth":1},{"line":22,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5],"total":22,"target":11},"depth":1},{"line":24,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5],"total":22,"target":11,"n":4},"depth":1},{"line":25,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5],"total":22,"target":11,"n":4},"depth":1},{"line":24,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5],"total":22,"target":11,"n":4},"depth":1},{"line":25,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5],"total":22,"target":11,"n":4},"depth":1},{"line":33,"locals":{"nums":[1,5,11,5],"total":22,"target":11,"dfs":"<_lru_cache_wrapper>","n":4},"depth":1},{"line":26,"locals":{"start":0,"remain":11,"dfs":"<_lru_cache_wrapper>","n":4,"nums":[1,5,11,5]},"depth":2},{"line":28,"locals":{"start":0,"remain":11,"dfs":"<_lru_cache_wrapper>","n":4,"nums":[1,5,11,5]},"depth":2},{"line":30,"locals":{"start":0,"remain":11,"dfs":"<_lru_cache_wrapper>","n":4,"nums":[1,5,11,5]},"depth":2},{"line":26